==English==
===Noun===
'''[[blue]] [[tit]]'''
# a small bird of the [[tit]] family [[Paridae]], with an azure blue crown and dark blue line passing through the eye and encircling the white cheeks to the chin.

====Scientific names====
*[[Parus caeruleus]]
*[[Cyanistes caeruleus]]

